.png/50px-Portrait_Kepli.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Kepli\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Kepli.png/25px-Portrait_Kepli.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7b/Portrait_Kepli.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Kepli\" title=\"Kepli\">Kepli</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Bloomridge_Park\" title=\"Bloomridge Park\">Bloomridge Park</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Please accept my apologies for being unable to attend today, dears - things are busier at the stall than they've ever been! Perhaps people are more given to losing themselves in a good book, with all that's going on in the world. In any case, I hope I can attend the next gathering, as I've come across some <i>very</i> intriguing prospects that the group may care to consider. \n</p><p><br>\nHappy Reading, \n</p><p>Nansi.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714213414\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.062 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.066 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2221/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 34808/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9498/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.018/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 992075/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   52.630      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   52.630      1 -total\n 42.59%   22.413      8 Template:Icon_text\n 40.18%   21.145     25 Template:Trim\n 38.23%   20.122      1 Template:PageSeo\n 38.20%   20.106      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 29.33%   15.438 